        "original_id": "2de870ed-f85c-5dd6-a49a-e01e09c03560",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Louise; Le roi malgré lui\n- People: Gustave Charpentier; Saint-Pol-Roux; Emmanuel Chabrier; Emile de Najac; Paul Burani\n- Topics: opera genres; librettos\n\nFacts:\n- In 1887, Emmanuel Chabrier created Le roi malgré lui, an opéra-comique in three acts.\n- Emile de Najac and Paul Burani wrote the original libretto for Le roi malgré lui.\n- Gustave Charpentier created Louise, a four-act opera described as a \"roman musical.\"\n- Gustave Charpentier wrote the original French libretto for Louise.\n- Saint-Pol-Roux, a symbolist poet who inspired the surrealists, contributed to the libretto of Louise.",
